      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "(Section 2) Purpose Title Appropriation B. 1 .. Parliament .. .. .. .. $ 371,200 B. 3 .. Audit Department .. .. .. B. 4 .. Election Commission .. .. B. 5 .. Public Services Commission .. Purpose Title Appropriation B. 7 .. Prime Minister's Department .. $16,244,759 B. 13 .. Ministry of Justice .. .. .. B. 17 .. Ministry of Youth and Sports .. B. 20 .. Ministry of Trade and Industry .. B. 21 .. Ministry of Culture and Tourism .. B. 24 .. Department of National Library .. B. 25 .. Ministry of Defence .. .. B. 26 .. Ministry of Education .. .. B. 27 .. Ministry of Foreign Affairs .. B. 30 .. Contribution to Statutory Funds .. B. 32 .. Inland Revenue Department .. B. 34 .. Ministry of Health .. .. .. B. 53 .. Ministry of Land and Regional Development.. .. .. .. 11,000,000 TOTAL .. $246,315,679"
